# WOI Equity Market Extremes Radar - environment template
# The MVP needs NO secrets. Data is downloaded by `npm run data:update`
# (Yahoo Finance + FRED public endpoints, no key) and served as static JSON.
#
# Never put API keys in any variable starting with VITE_ : Vite copies those
# into the public JavaScript bundle where anyone can read them.

# Optional: FRED API key for a future server-side job (NOT used by the MVP).
# FRED_API_KEY=

# Optional: first year kept for the S&P 500 history (default 1950).
# WOI_SPX_START_YEAR=1950
